### 🎛️ Quantum Circuit Architecture
Below is the standard layout for generating a 2-qubit maximally entangled Bell State (\(\vert{}\Phi^+\rangle = \frac{\vert{}00\rangle + \vert{}11\rangle}{\sqrt{2}}\)):

```text
        ┌───┐      
q_0: ───┤ H ├──■───
        └───┘┌─┴─┐
q_1: ────────┤ X ├─
             └───┘
m: 2/══════════════
```

